## ObjectType: Trade Order

Accepted or projected buy/sell instruction identifying account, instrument and broker. The example permits one fill per order.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| order_id | Order Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | order_id |
| account_id | Account Id | string | Foreign key to accounts; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | account_id |
| instrument_id | Instrument Id | string | Foreign key to financial_instruments; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | instrument_id |
| counterparty_id | Counterparty Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | counterparty_id |
| order_date | Order Date | date | Date of this business event under the fictional weekday calendar; distinguish planned and actual. | order_date |
| side | Side | string | Source buy/sell direction uses the language-specific allowed values. Native reconstructed row.side uses stable buy/sell machine codes in both languages. Allowed values: buy, sell. | side |
| order_quantity | Order Quantity | decimal | Positive business quantity in the linked instrument’s share or face units. | order_quantity |
| order_status | Order Status | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: accepted, planned. | order_status |
| view_kind | View Kind | string | actual is a synthetic observed fact; planned is an explicit forecast known at the observation date, never actual future completion. Allowed values: actual, planned. | view_kind |
| known_date | Known Date | date | Date this fact/assumption was available; actual facts cannot use future knowledge, planned assumptions are known by 2027-02-28. | known_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: order_id
Display Key: order_id
